; bothflags.hl - one ADD setting both flags at once: 255 + 1
; The full adder carries out (CF=1) and the result is zero (ZF=1) in
; the same instruction - the only byte whose successor is exactly 0
; with a carry. (The .asm original demonstrates JC and JZ both testing
; that one operation; the arithmetic here is the same.)
var a = 15
a = a + 240
out a
a = a + 1
out a
halt
